# Optional. Copy to ~/.config/mcp-qmedia/env (or point MCP_QMEDIA_ENV at it).
# Everything here is non-secret; the API key never goes in this file or the repo.
# The server reads the key from QMEDIA_API_KEY / OPENCODE_API_KEY, otherwise from
# opencode's own store ~/.local/share/opencode/auth.json (entries "opencode-go" / "opencode").

# Default backend: go (opencode go, mimo-v2.5, paid, 1M ctx) or free (opencode zen, mimo-v2.5-free)
#QMEDIA_BACKEND=go
# Where opencode keeps its provider keys
#QMEDIA_AUTH_JSON=/home/YOU/.local/share/opencode/auth.json
# Per-file size cap before ffmpeg transcoding kicks in (bytes)
#QMEDIA_MAX_BYTES=20000000
# HTTP timeout for the model call (seconds) - video can be slow
#QMEDIA_TIMEOUT=300
# Interpreter override for the launcher (default: .venv/bin/python in the checkout)
#MCP_QMEDIA_PYTHON=/home/YOU/.local/src/ai-agent-setup/mcp/mcp-qmedia/.venv/bin/python
